WEBVTT

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:08.470
We require at least one victory against the Sekirei from the North.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.160
It should be an easy job for you, considering your close relationship with them, correct?

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.050
I have no idea what you're planning, but...

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.750
I've already made my decision.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:25.130
I'll do anything to protect Chiho's life.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.340
A truly sincere decision.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:46.330
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:46.330
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:53.420
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:53.420
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:00:53.420 --> 00:01:00.260
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:00:53.420 --> 00:01:00.260
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:06.440
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:06.440
I will believe in your smile

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.650
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.650
If I can protect your dream,

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.240
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.240
I will even embrace pain

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:23.540
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:23.540
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:30.290
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:30.290
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:38.510
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.090
yes, my passion accelerates

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.510
as if it were rushing through my body

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.680
aa, donna unmei datte

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.680
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:55.820
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.980
yes, I can fly high over it

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:55.820
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.340
Do you like kitty-cats too?

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.270
Yes, I love them.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.610
Kitty-cat!

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.190
It ran away...

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:20.120
I'm sorry.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.220
Don't worry, it's not your fault.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:36.040
It's not that I can't walk, but... They say walking puts too much pressure on my body.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.760
Are you... sick?

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:43.270
Yeah. Though I wish I could get better soon, and be able to run around like you.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.620
What's wrong?

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.640
You know...

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.340
Kuu-chan!

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:52.840
Oh, it's Onii-chan!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:55.220
It looks like he's looking for you.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:59.580
I came here by myself while chasing the kitty-cat.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.370
Then you better hurry up and go back to him.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.380
Yup!

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:05.600
See you, Onee-chan!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:06.520
Bye.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.340
You know!

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:16.180
You can run! I know you definitely will be able to run!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.100
Yup.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.970
Bye, bye!

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:25.590
This...!

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.060
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:29.970
What's that?

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.590
Kuu-chan!

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.860
Jeez... All you do is fight!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:40.290
You're so freakin' useless! And you were just about lose, for god's sake...

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.010
Man, you're beyond help...

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.700
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.080
A-Are you all right?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.760
A-A Sekirei?

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.770
Don't go touching my stuff!

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.870
It's cuz' you're so lousy!

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.760
I'm sorry!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.400
I'm sorry, Juuichi-san...

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.640
Hey, why are you hitting her?!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:08.120
Shut it. You ain't got nothing to do with this.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.560
It's okay...

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.240
He can do anything he pleases to me... It's okay...

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.740
B-But...!

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:17.710
I'm very sorry, please leave me alone.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.300
You heard the lady.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.130
Still got somethin' to say?

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.010
Hey! C'mon, we're going, Yashima!

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.550
Y-Yes, Juuichi-san...

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:34.530
That's not right...

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.580
Treating Sekirei in such a way...

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:40.180
Onii-chan!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:42.850
Kuu-chan! I'm so glad you're safe.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.990
Guess what! Kuu actually-

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.190
What is it?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.950
Kuu's teddy bear...

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:52.570
Huh?

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.700
There's no one here.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:04.870
Don't worry. We can probably find out who's keeping it if she's hospitalized here.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:05.750
Really?

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:10.890
Yeah. But the visiting hours are already over, so we'll come again tomorrow, okay?

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:11.830
Okay!

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:20.140
I asked the nurses, but none of them have seen the girl you mentioned.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:23.680
I can probably meet her again if she comes to this hospital often, right?

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:30.020
Hey, Chiho... What would you do if I...

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.430
I'd feel bad if she's looking for it right now...

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:31.770
Eh? What did you say?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.170
Oh, never mind...

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.980
Uzume-chan, are you crying?

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:40.880
I can tell. I'm your Ashikabi, after all.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:45.790
Whenever you're happy, I become happy too.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:49.410
Whenever you're sad, I'm sad as well.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:54.880
I know you smile for me even when you're overflowing with things one would cry about.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:59.180
I'm so glad that I'm your Sekirei...

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:01.380
Gee, I love you...

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.100
Chiho, can I kiss you? C'mon, can I kiss you?

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.720
Jeez... Uzume-chan.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.170
I love you, Chiho.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.690
Yup, me too.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:17.900
Consider everyone around us an enemy from now on, okay?

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.320
Just in case, okay?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.240
So... Why am I dressed like this yet again?

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:26.670
Don't worry! You look really good in those kinds of clothes!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.910
I-I see...

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:32.580
Those two are an Ashikabi and a Sekirei?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.380
Yeah, no mistake about it.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.890
I caught a glance of the Sekirei crest earlier.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:42.650
They sure look weak.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.140
So late!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.460
It's way past the time they were supposed to be back.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.310
I'm really worried...

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:59.330
I even told them about their time limit so many times!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:03.270
Maybe they're both having so much fun that they've simply forgotten about it.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.610
Wh-What?!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.410
I'm going out to look for them!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.830
Oh my, holding jealousy even towards Kuu-chan?

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:20.490
Sorry, I'm just going to the bathroom. Wait for me here.

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:21.170
Okay.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:33.520
This outfit is really embarrassing after all... Especially when I'm alone.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.420
You're a Sekirei, right?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.190
Go.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.630
No. 84 Yashima, proceeding.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.470
They said they'd go shopping, but...

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.160
What's going on?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.650
A Sekirei battle, huh?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.230
It's quite surprising to bump into one here.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.130
However...

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.720
I don't sense any will to fight in that Sekirei.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.510
Hey, moron!

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:11.220
Don't just hop around! Fight properly!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:15.190
And why the hell are you so slow?!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.240
I-I'm sorr

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:21.530
All you gotta do is beat the crap out of them if they don't feel like fighting back, right?

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:24.110
Move it, and beat that kid up already!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.240
What is that...?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:26.700
S-Such treatment...

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.240
Why aren't you fighting?!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:37.580
If you're a Sekirei, then why don't you confirm that your opponent is willing to fight in the first place?!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:41.340
Is she a Sekirei too?

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.730
Now's the time! Here!

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:03.690
Upon thy contract, I shall defeat the enemies of my Ashikabi.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.530
A Norito?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.300
Shiina!

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.030
Yukari-san!

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.910
Just beat them up!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.080
Understood.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:20.420
No. 107 Shiina. To you, the God of Death.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:23.340
Gravity Hammer!

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:28.820
Sorry.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.340
Wha- What... is it?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.170
Death Guard!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:42.060
Wow...

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.120
Juuichi-sama...

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:00.870
I'm sorry. It must've hurt... I'm so sorry.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.290
Yashima!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.710
How could you do that to my Yashima?!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.090
That man... Just how far is he willing to go?

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.420
Are you okay, Shiina?!

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.030
He didn't do anything weird to you, right?!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.840
Aww, don't cry!

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.990
You're ruining your beautiful face...

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.290
Gonna freakin' kill you...!

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.590
H-Huh?

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:33.160
You really don't have any shame! I'll eliminate you!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:41.250
The hell you doin', bitch?!

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:46.840
Heh, you really <i>are</i> the worst.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.300
Sorry-

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:59.980
Not only do you hit a girl, but you even take out a knife?

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.750
Indeed. That's an issue way past being an Ashikabi or not.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:03.530
Huh?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:08.570
Um... You helped us, right? Thank you.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:12.240
Uh, no... I just happened to be passing by...

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:14.950
Yukari-san, she's a Sekirei as well.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:16.410
What?! A Sekirei?

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:18.840
More like...

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:20.990
Big boobies!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:21.700
Huh?!

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.710
You also have beautiful hair... I wanna touch it!

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:28.420
A pervert...! There's a pervert here...!

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:31.000
I-I need to get going now...

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.420
R-Right! So, I'll excuse myself for now!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.570
Hey, wait a sec! Can't you at least let me touch you?!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:40.180
Huh? M.B.I.'s helicopters.

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:43.060
Oh, that's right.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:47.280
We're off the target list now.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:58.450
I-I really shouldn't get involved with those kind of people...

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.890
It's exactly as Matsu said.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:09.700
Right now, I'd never know when Minato could get attacked...

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.550
Hey! Tsukiumi!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:13.960
Minato.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.380
I see.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.050
So that's why you were late.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.650
And what were you doing, Tsukiumi?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:24.890
Tsukiumi?

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:31.070
I-I went to look for you since you were running late,
just in case you got caught up in something dangerous!

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:35.810
Did you really think I could get jealous because of something you and this midget were doing?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.710
I haven't said anything, though...

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:49.470
There all sorts of Ashikabi and Sekirei, huh...

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.500
What is it?

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.660
I was just thinking about how glad I am to be your Sekirei.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:00.120
Wh-What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:09.950
I... I won!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:10.860
Are you okay?!

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:12.250
Yes!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:14.010
You did it, Namiji!

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:16.820
I finally won a battle, Kouji-san!

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:18.780
Dammit! Damn it!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.240
Um... Sorry.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.950
Don't apologize!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.110
I know...

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:30.180
This is just the way this game is...

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:33.290
I know... I know, but still...!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.390
Damn! Damn it!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:41.840
But... why did the Sekirei Project suddenly... turn out this way...

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.310
I don't agree with rock-paper-scissors, or any of the other games!

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:52.090
Aren't there any other challenges left?

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:56.090
In other words, you won't agree with games that you cannot win.

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:57.690
Oh, shut up, Matsu.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.530
Why don't we do it more Sekirei-like? How about a sexy contest?

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:05.070
Matsu won't lose in those kinds of games, either!

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.240
What do you think, Minato-kun?

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.500
Or we could just let our fists settle this!

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:17.380
Right... I think I'd rather have you do it the peaceful way...

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.230
Mi-Minato!

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:21.930
Are you really saying that you'd prefer the sexy contest then?!

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:25.350
I-I am not!

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:32.990
I witnessed five Sekirei battles when looking around last night alone.

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.980
Minaka's plan is obviously working... and it's efficient, too.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.150
Oh? Kagari-san.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.920
Good job in there.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.960
Um... Kagari-san.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:47.870
What is it?

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:54.250
There are many Sekirei fighting desperately out there, thinking they have to win at least once, right?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.000
I was just thinking... Is it really okay for us to sit around and do nothing?

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:02.760
Well, this rule doesn't affect us.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:08.220
But being forcefully separated from the person you love...

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.000
Even though this is just a game...

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:14.190
I could never agree to that.

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.600
Sahashi...

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:20.190
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:24.490
That's something you need to figure out on your own.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:29.820
And then we, your Sekirei, will follow you.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.580
According to your wish, that is.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.190
Kagari-san...

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.770
"Will follow you," huh?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:40.820
A phrase I'd never have said as my old self.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.130
Though... It's not so bad.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:48.970
Minato!

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.430
We decided to fight it out in Mud sumo wresting!

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.440
M-Mud sumo wrestling?

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:56.850
Izumo Inn

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:59.060
This place is as lively as usual.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:02.190
Sorry, sorry... Sorry for always troubling you.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.190
It's all right.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:10.160
I already know that all of this is the fault of your irresponsible and lazy master.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.840
But... is this okay?

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.020
What are you talking about?

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:17.070
Stop acting dumb.

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:19.310
The incident this time. It's probably...

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.130
Who knows?

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:26.050
Are you really okay with that? You'll never be safe with this many Sekirei around.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:32.390
It wouldn't be a surprise if someone decided to attack this place, while not knowing how fearsome the Demon of the North really is.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:36.190
I'll have to make sure they play outside when that happens.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:40.560
It would be quite troublesome if they were to mess up the house.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.780
You're really scary, you know?

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:46.490
Hello?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.000
You're Seo Kaoru-san, right?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.160
Who is this?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:54.510
Hello. My name is Higa.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:58.150
Th-They really did it...

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.220
I won!

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:02.750
Musubi came second!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.170
Twenty-five meatballs...

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:08.840
We're only going to look for the teddy bear at the hospital...

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.930
Only people who won up to the second place are allowed to come along.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:16.230
I finally won. It would be absolutely boring if there were no rewards involved.

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:22.380
Their reasons aside, you have nothing to worry about with those two around you.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.400
You're right, but...

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.820
But, please do be careful at all times.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.460
Matsu-san... Did something happen?

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.520
Minato! What are you doing?

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.980
Oh, right!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.660
Um, Matsu-san...

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.750
I'm probably just over thinking it.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.760
You go ahead now!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:40.330
Okay...

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.530
It's about time they arrive.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.740
Aren't they just going to the hospital?

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.050
What are you so worried about?

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.660
I just have a feeling that something's not right...

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.910
Something's not right?

00:17:58.490 --> 00:17:59.060
Oh!

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:00.380
What's wrong?

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:03.580
There's a Sekirei en route towards Mina-tan!

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:05.020
Please do not use your cellphone in the Hospital!!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:05.150
Please do not use your cellphone in the Hospital!!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:05.270
Please do not use your cellphone in the Hospital!!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:05.400
Please do not use your cellphone in the Hospital!!

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:05.520
Please do not use your cellphone in the Hospital!!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:05.650
Please do not use your cellphone in the Hospital!!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.420
Oh, yeah...

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.360
E-Excuse me.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.140
Can I help you?

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.990
We're looking for someone.

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.950
You just won't listen to us, will you?!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:22.410
As we were saying, it's a young girl!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.530
But with just that amount of information...

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.340
Uu-chan!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.680
Uzume!

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:29.720
Uzume-san!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:33.900
Oh? What are you guys doing here?

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.940
I'm so glad we were able to meet again.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:39.380
And I'm surprised you were Uzume-chan's friend, too.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:42.730
Is this the person the Landlady was talking about?

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:46.950
She's been hospitalized for a long time now.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.240
Is she... Uzume-san's Ashikabi?

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:55.880
I don't know. But I do understand the depth of their bond.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.410
So she's an Ashikabi...

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.580
I'm glad to see you're doing well.

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.610
Suddenly disappearing without saying a single word...

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:08.630
Sorry... I know I was supposed to call, but...

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:13.250
Oh yeah, I'd like you guys to do me a little favour concerning that...

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.050
A favour?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:18.560
It's a bit difficult to talk about it here, so would you mind stepping outside?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.020
Sure...

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:23.690
He's turned off his cellphone. I can't check up on them any more.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:26.470
You're not allowed to use cellphones at the hospital, after all.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.520
Hospital...?

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.320
That's it! It's the hospital!

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:31.760
What?

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:33.240
The reason why I had the feeling that something was off.

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:37.160
Uzume-tan's Ashikabi is being hospitalized there right now.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.760
I'm going.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.410
Kazehana-tan!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.600
Please, contact me if things get too bad.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.840
In the worst case, I will go as well.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:50.850
Oh, but you can't.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:54.760
The entire Capital will drop into chaos if you leave this place.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:20:00.260
And if things really turn out that way,

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:04.730
I think I will be the one to put an end to it.

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:07.270
So you're wearing those costumes?

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:09.540
Uu-chan gave them to me.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.550
The birdie, the mouse...

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.360
I wonder where they all went.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:18.740
Uzume-chan said she was only going out for a bit...

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.330
I'm sorry, Sahashi-san.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.040
Oh, no. That's not what I meant.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.410
That person...

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.750
He was the one aiming for Kagari-san.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:32.600
I-I feel a bit thirsty, so I'm just going to go buy a drink.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.850
I'm sorry, but please look after Kuu-chan for me.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:36.800
Sure thing.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.100
Yes, it's an absolute coincidence.

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:48.390
There are three Sekirei from the North.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.220
No, only two of them were brought out.

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.850
The certain way to get them would be...

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.850
Okay, I understand.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:57.710
We could always reinforce...

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:04.750
There's no way No. 10 would succumb to her emotions, as long as her Ashikabi's life is on the line, right?

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:08.420
No. 10... could it be Uzume-san?!

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:11.080
She will probably bring them down without hesitation.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.960
Sekirei are nothing but mere Sekirei, after all.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.380
B-Bring down...?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.840
Musubi-chan, Tsukiumi!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.910
Uzume-san is really taking her time.

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:26.580
Honestly, how long is she going to make us wait?

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:28.190
Sorry.

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:30.980
What on Earth are you trying to make us do-

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:32.420
Huh?

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:35.190
Clothed... Sekirei.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.050
Is it... Uzume-san?

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:42.450
Y-You!

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:43.800
Sorry.

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:47.000
Could you die?

